Falsifies `address_space_layout::verification::service_window_accepts_every_page_of_its_band`.

The defect: `service_window` checks against `HEAP`, so every page of `SERVICE_WINDOWS` is refused.

Expected to fail: Kani reports "a window must lie wholly inside its band" reachable for a page of `SERVICE_WINDOWS`.

diff --git a/crates/address_space_layout/src/lib.rs b/crates/address_space_layout/src/lib.rs
index cb71c3977..a87d1948f 100644
--- a/crates/address_space_layout/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/address_space_layout/src/lib.rs
@@ -270,7 +270,7 @@ pub const INITIAL_RAMDISK_VIRTUAL_ADDRESS: u64 = runtime_window(0x2000_0000);
 /// **A service window's address, checked against the map at compile time.** As [`pair_page`], for
 /// [`SERVICE_WINDOWS`].
 pub const fn service_window(virtual_address: u64) -> u64 {
-    window(SERVICE_WINDOWS, virtual_address, PAGE_BYTES)
+    window(HEAP, virtual_address, PAGE_BYTES)
 }
 
